OL,3,AHow The Traitors' music plays with your
OL,4,Aemotions
OL,5,
OL,6,FSuspicion, intrigue, treachery, Claudia
OL,7,FWinkleman. The Traitors has it all.
OL,9,FBut the shadowiest of the show's
OL,10,Fshadowy secrets is its music.
OL,12,FHave you ever noticed how the
OL,13,Fsoundtrack manipulates your perception?
OL,14,FA sinister orchestral flourish hints at
OL,15,Fa double cross. A cheeky chord injects
OL,16,Fhumour into a kitchen conflab.
OL,18,FAs ever, though, you shouldn't trust
OL,19,Fwhat happens in the castle. The music
OL,20,Fcan provide emphasis or act as
OL,21,Fmisdirection, all at the producers'
OL,22,Fbehest.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/18
