OL,3,AComedian Paul Whitehouse mugged at
OL,4,ALondon cash machine
OL,5,
OL,6,FActor and comedian Paul Whitehouse has
OL,7,Ffought back against someone who tried
OL,8,Fto steal his card at an London cash
OL,9,Fmachine, according to his wife.
OL,11,FDr Mine Conkbayir posted on Instagram
OL,12,Fthat her husband had gone out to get
OL,13,Fsome medication on Friday, when he was
OL,14,Fmugged at a cash machine behind a
OL,15,FSainsbury's in Islington.
OL,17,F"He did fight back and retrieved his
OL,18,Fcard, with the perp scuttling away
OL,19,Fempty-handed," she wrote, warning
OL,20,Fpeople to be "super vigilant" out
OL,21,Fthere.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/18
